# Env files

Hard rule — full policy in `CLAUDE.md` § Env files. Enforced by `.cursor/hooks/` (shell + read).

Never read, open, search, or print `.env*` files except `*.env.example`. If a real env file is missing, copy from the matching example and leave placeholders for the user to fill in.
